  "comments": [
    {"at":0,"placement":"line","text":"Sets both fighters to the start of a bout: start positions, move $00, facing, energy and score 0. Sets the walk-in flag."},
    {"at":8,"placement":"side","text":"Start position: $00 for fighter 0, $1f for fighter 1."},
    {"at":18,"placement":"side","text":"Fighter 0 faces right, fighter 1 faces left."},
    {"at":29,"placement":"side","text":"X = $ff: the fighters walk in."},
    {"at":32,"placement":"line","text":"Resets fighter X for a bout. A is the corner animation (stored with bit 7 set). Energy 12, idle timer $ff."},
    {"at":49,"placement":"line","text":"Sets the 5 score digits of fighter X to 0. The score is the text $87 (fighter 0) or $88 (fighter 1)."},
    {"at":65,"placement":"side","text":"The digits are at offset 3-7 of the text."}
  ],
